## Directory Layout

```
frontend/src/
+-- app/
|   +-- App.tsx         Route registry - ALL routes declared here
|   +-- routes/         Lazy-loaded route components
+-- features/           One directory per domain feature
|   +-- [feature]/
|       +-- pages/      Page components (route-level)
|       +-- components/ Feature-local components
|       +-- hooks/      Feature-local ViewModel hooks
|       +-- types.ts    Feature-local TypeScript types
+-- shared/             Cross-feature shared code - import from here, not from other features
|   +-- components/     Shared UI components (see registry below)
|   +-- hooks/          Shared utility hooks
|   +-- api/            API client and endpoint helpers
|   +-- config/         Constants, permissions, feature flags
|   +-- types/          Shared TypeScript types
+-- lib/                Third-party library wrappers
```

