## Auth Token

andrei uses these to authenticate before Playwright verification:

- Login endpoint: `[e.g. POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login]`
- Login body: `[e.g. { "email": "admin@example.com", "password": "password123" }]`
- Token field in response: `[e.g. response.data.accessToken]`
- Token storage: `[e.g. sessionStorage.setItem('auth-token', token)]`
- Admin credentials: `[e.g. admin@example.com / password123]`
- Regular user: `[e.g. user@example.com / password123]`

