## Route Registration

All routes are declared in one file. **Do not add routes anywhere else.**

```
Route file: [e.g. frontend/src/app/App.tsx]
Pattern: [e.g. <Route path="/feature/:id" element={<FeaturePage />} />]
Lazy loading: [e.g. const FeaturePage = lazy(() => import('../features/feature/pages/FeaturePage'))]
```

