## Data Flow Pattern

**Read this before writing any component that fetches or mutates data.**

```
[e.g. ViewModel pattern:
  - Page component calls useFeatureViewModel() hook
  - Hook owns all state, loading flags, error state
  - Hook returns { data, isLoading, error, actions }
  - Components receive props from the ViewModel, never fetch directly
  - No direct API calls from components]

[OR]

[e.g. React Query pattern:
  - Use useQuery for reads, useMutation for writes
  - Query keys: [featureName, params] tuple
  - API functions live in shared/api/<feature>.api.ts
  - Components use the query hooks - never call fetch directly]
```

